==== 5G Network ====

The 802.11AC, or 5G wireless capability is provided kmod-mt76 package.
It may be installed via terminal

<code> opkg update && opkg -y install kmod-mt76</code>

Or through LuCI Software page.

After rebooting, the LuCi will present the 5G network in Wifi page.

